---
// src/pages/privacy.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | InfraHub"
  description="InfraHub's data protection and privacy policy for infrastructure inquiries and customer data."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <div class="section section-hero network-overlay">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-date">Last Updated: August 2026</p>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <h2>1. Overview & Commitment</h2>
        <p>
          InfraHub ("we", "us", "our") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal and corporate data you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, process, and safeguard information submitted through <a href="https://infrahub.tech">infrahub.tech</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you submit a technical requirement or request an infrastructure offer through our qualification forms, we collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> Your name, business email address, company name, and optional telephone number.</li>
          <li><strong>Technical Specifications:</strong> Details regarding your required infrastructure, bandwidth commits, geographic locations, and implementation timelines.</li>
          <li><strong>Attribution Telemetry:</strong> Referral sources, campaign identifiers, and landing pages to analyze sourcing demand.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <p>We process your data strictly to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Review and qualify your infrastructure, connectivity, or hardware requirements.</li>
          <li>Evaluate appropriate specialist providers across our independent partner network.</li>
          <li>Facilitate direct introductions to agreed-upon partner organizations with your consent.</li>
          <li>Provide customer support and follow up on commercial inquiries.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Data Sharing & Third Parties</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. Your contact and technical requirements are shared exclusively with selected infrastructure providers after initial qualification and solely for the purpose of preparing commercial proposals.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Data Security & Retention</h2>
        <p>
          We employ industry-standard encryption (TLS 1.3 in transit, AES-256 at rest) to protect your submissions. Data is retained only as long as necessary to fulfill the commercial inquiry or satisfy legal compliance obligations.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Contact & Rights</h2>
        <p>
          Under applicable data protection regulations (including GDPR), you have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information. To exercise these rights, please contact our Data Protection Office at:
        </p>
        <p class="contact-box">
          Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@infrahub.tech">privacy@infrahub.tech</a><br />
          Inquiries: <a href="mailto:inquiries@infrahub.tech">inquiries@infrahub.tech</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 800px;
  }
  .legal-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .legal-date {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }
  .legal-content {
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 32px 0 14px;
  }
  .legal-content p {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .legal-content ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .legal-content li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .contact-box {
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
</style>
